{"id":"vol8-08","section":4,"path":"bank/listening/vol8-08/audio-4.m4a","model":"small","duration":430.34,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":0.5,"text":"Part 4.","words":[["Part",0.0,0.18],["4.",0.18,0.5]]},{"start":1.7,"end":6.8,"text":"You will hear the first part of a lecture about some research into child development.","words":[["You",1.7,2.02],["will",2.02,2.18],["hear",2.18,2.4],["the",2.4,2.6],["first",2.6,2.9],["part",2.9,3.26],["of",3.26,3.4],["a",3.4,3.56],["lecture",3.56,3.88],["about",3.88,4.58],["some",4.58,4.9],["research",4.9,5.38],["into",5.38,5.74],["child",5.74,6.2],["development.",6.2,6.8]]},{"start":7.8,"end":11.44,"text":"First you have some time to look at questions 31 to 40.","words":[["First",7.8,8.44],["you",8.44,8.62],["have",8.62,8.78],["some",8.78,8.94],["time",8.94,9.3],["to",9.3,9.52],["look",9.52,9.64],["at",9.64,9.78],["questions",9.78,10.08],["31",10.08,10.84],["to",10.84,11.06],["40.",11.06,11.44]]},{"start":67.04,"end":71.1,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 31 to 40.","words":[["Now",67.04,67.38],["listen",67.38,67.72],["carefully",67.72,68.2],["and",68.2,68.54],["answer",68.54,69.04],["questions",69.04,69.48],["31",69.48,70.4],["to",70.4,70.72],["40.",70.72,71.1]]},{"start":74.37,"end":75.27,"text":"Good afternoon.","words":[["Good",74.37,74.79],["afternoon.",74.79,75.27]]},{"start":75.95,"end":78.61,"text":"The subject of my lecture today is child psychology.","words":[["The",75.95,76.11],["subject",76.11,76.43],["of",76.43,76.71],["my",76.71,76.85],["lecture",76.85,77.15],["today",77.15,77.55],["is",77.55,77.93],["child",77.93,78.27],["psychology.",78.27,78.61]]},{"start":79.65,"end":84.19,"text":"I'm going to talk about research in that area, how it has changed in recent years,","words":[["I'm",79.65,79.93],["going",79.93,80.07],["to",80.07,80.19],["talk",80.19,80.39],["about",80.39,80.65],["research",80.65,81.09],["in",81.09,81.39],["that",81.39,81.55],["area,",81.55,81.89],["how",82.31,82.51],["it",82.51,82.63],["has",82.63,82.77],["changed",82.77,83.19],["in",83.19,83.49],["recent",83.49,83.81],["years,",83.81,84.19]]},{"start":84.19,"end":86.75,"text":"and how it's likely to develop in future.","words":[["and",84.19,84.87],["how",84.87,85.09],["it's",85.09,85.27],["likely",85.27,85.53],["to",85.53,85.79],["develop",85.79,86.15],["in",86.15,86.39],["future.",86.39,86.75]]},{"start":87.59,"end":90.27,"text":"First of all, there's the way we look at the subject","words":[["First",87.59,87.89],["of",87.89,88.09],["all,",88.09,88.31],["there's",88.59,88.91],["the",88.91,89.03],["way",89.03,89.21],["we",89.21,89.39],["look",89.39,89.59],["at",89.59,89.73],["the",89.73,89.83],["subject",89.83,90.27]]},{"start":90.27,"end":92.07,"text":"of child psychology itself.","words":[["of",90.27,90.47],["child",90.47,90.85],["psychology",90.85,91.59],["itself.",91.59,92.07]]},{"start":92.89,"end":95.95,"text":"Traditionally, we used to talk about three different aspects","words":[["Traditionally,",92.89,93.47],["we",93.97,94.11],["used",94.11,94.33],["to",94.33,94.47],["talk",94.47,94.67],["about",94.67,94.91],["three",94.91,95.21],["different",95.21,95.49],["aspects",95.49,95.95]]},{"start":95.95,"end":98.67,"text":"of a child's development, social development,","words":[["of",95.95,96.25],["a",96.25,96.35],["child's",96.35,96.83],["development,",96.83,97.23],["social",97.77,98.13],["development,",98.13,98.67]]},{"start":99.31,"end":101.39,"text":"that's how the child relates to other people,","words":[["that's",99.31,99.53],["how",99.53,99.65],["the",99.65,99.79],["child",99.79,100.15],["relates",100.15,100.59],["to",100.59,100.85],["other",100.85,101.03],["people,",101.03,101.39]]},{"start":101.95,"end":104.89,"text":"cognitive development, how a child reasons","words":[["cognitive",101.95,102.49],["development,",102.49,103.13],["how",103.67,103.85],["a",103.85,103.99],["child",103.99,104.31],["reasons",104.31,104.89]]},{"start":104.89,"end":109.57,"text":"or explains things to himself, and emotional development,","words":[["or",104.89,105.27],["explains",105.27,105.77],["things",105.77,106.25],["to",106.25,106.55],["himself,",106.55,106.97],["and",107.57,107.99],["emotional",107.99,108.87],["development,",108.87,109.57]]},{"start":110.09,"end":113.49,"text":"how the child feels about people and things and events","words":[["how",110.09,110.31],["the",110.31,110.45],["child",110.45,110.81],["feels",110.81,111.21],["about",111.21,111.59],["people",111.59,111.99],["and",111.99,112.33],["things",112.33,112.73],["and",112.73,113.07],["events",113.07,113.49]]},{"start":113.49,"end":115.23,"text":"events in the world around him.","words":[["events",113.49,113.65],["in",113.65,114.07],["the",114.07,114.19],["world",114.19,114.47],["around",114.47,114.85],["him.",114.85,115.23]]},{"start":116.69,"end":122.75,"text":"And those three areas were kept very separate, and different psychologists used to work in","words":[["And",116.69,117.33],["those",117.33,117.65],["three",117.65,117.89],["areas",117.89,118.37],["were",118.37,118.79],["kept",118.79,119.05],["very",119.05,119.41],["separate,",119.41,119.85],["and",120.11,120.55],["different",120.55,120.83],["psychologists",120.83,121.51],["used",121.51,122.11],["to",122.11,122.27],["work",122.27,122.49],["in",122.49,122.75]]},{"start":122.75,"end":123.49,"text":"different areas.","words":[["different",122.75,122.99],["areas.",122.99,123.49]]},{"start":124.01,"end":129.63,"text":"But what you have now is the growing realization that you can't draw those hard and fast boundaries.","words":[["But",124.01,124.51],["what",124.51,124.73],["you",124.73,124.89],["have",124.89,125.09],["now",125.09,125.33],["is",125.33,125.49],["the",125.49,125.61],["growing",125.61,125.89],["realization",125.89,126.45],["that",126.45,126.85],["you",126.85,126.97],["can't",126.97,127.45],["draw",127.45,127.79],["those",127.79,128.13],["hard",128.13,128.55],["and",128.55,128.69],["fast",128.69,129.09],["boundaries.",129.09,129.63]]},{"start":130.19,"end":132.77,"text":"The three aspects are all seen to be connected.","words":[["The",130.19,130.43],["three",130.43,130.63],["aspects",130.63,131.17],["are",131.17,131.41],["all",131.41,131.71],["seen",131.71,132.01],["to",132.01,132.21],["be",132.21,132.35],["connected.",132.35,132.77]]},{"start":133.35,"end":134.55,"text":"So that's the first thing.","words":[["So",133.35,133.57],["that's",133.57,133.87],["the",133.87,134.03],["first",134.03,134.25],["thing.",134.25,134.55]]},{"start":135.39,"end":136.21,"text":"Another thing.","words":[["Another",135.39,135.81],["thing.",135.81,136.21]]},{"start":136.71,"end":141.21,"text":"In the past, people tended to study behavior in artificial contexts.","words":[["In",136.71,136.89],["the",136.89,136.99],["past,",136.99,137.43],["people",137.83,138.13],["tended",138.13,138.55],["to",138.55,138.79],["study",138.79,139.07],["behavior",139.07,139.61],["in",139.61,139.85],["artificial",139.85,140.43],["contexts.",140.43,141.21]]},{"start":141.21,"end":145.11,"text":"Take, for example, the type of behavior referred to as learning.","words":[["Take,",141.21,142.07],["for",142.15,142.25],["example,",142.25,142.59],["the",142.97,143.09],["type",143.09,143.35],["of",143.35,143.49],["behavior",143.49,143.81],["referred",143.81,144.27],["to",144.27,144.57],["as",144.57,144.77],["learning.",144.77,145.11]]},{"start":145.89,"end":150.55,"text":"Traditionally, it was investigated by studying how animals behave in laboratories.","words":[["Traditionally,",145.89,146.45],["it",146.83,146.87],["was",146.87,146.97],["investigated",146.97,147.49],["by",147.49,147.87],["studying",147.87,148.29],["how",148.29,148.79],["animals",148.79,149.27],["behave",149.27,149.79],["in",149.79,150.03],["laboratories.",150.03,150.55]]},{"start":151.43,"end":156.97,"text":"But now, thanks to psychologists like Vygotsky, there's a growing realization","words":[["But",151.43,151.93],["now,",151.93,152.25],["thanks",152.65,152.99],["to",152.99,153.21],["psychologists",153.21,154.07],["like",154.07,154.43],["Vygotsky,",154.43,155.13],["there's",155.65,155.91],["a",155.91,156.01],["growing",156.01,156.31],["realization",156.31,156.97]]},{"start":156.97,"end":160.89,"text":"that you can't isolate things that happen during childhood.","words":[["that",156.97,157.81],["you",157.81,157.95],["can't",157.95,158.37],["isolate",158.37,158.81],["things",158.81,159.27],["that",159.27,159.55],["happen",159.55,159.93],["during",159.93,160.29],["childhood.",160.29,160.89]]},{"start":161.61,"end":164.85,"text":"Behavior is very much influenced by the child's background","words":[["Behavior",161.61,162.07],["is",162.07,162.47],["very",162.47,162.73],["much",162.73,163.01],["influenced",163.01,163.41],["by",163.41,163.77],["the",163.77,163.89],["child's",163.89,164.39],["background",164.39,164.85]]},{"start":164.85,"end":169.25,"text":"and by the particular situation that he or she is in at the moment.","words":[["and",164.85,165.71],["by",165.71,165.97],["the",165.97,166.09],["particular",166.09,166.49],["situation",166.49,167.11],["that",167.11,167.89],["he",167.89,168.09],["or",168.09,168.19],["she",168.19,168.43],["is",168.43,168.61],["in",168.61,168.75],["at",168.75,168.85],["the",168.85,168.93],["moment.",168.93,169.25]]},{"start":169.25,"end":174.45,"text":"Is he with peers? Is he with teachers? Is he with parents? And so on.","words":[["Is",169.25,169.95],["he",169.95,170.03],["with",170.03,170.21],["peers?",170.21,170.57],["Is",171.13,171.21],["he",171.21,171.31],["with",171.31,171.47],["teachers?",171.47,171.85],["Is",172.27,172.45],["he",172.45,172.53],["with",172.53,172.69],["parents?",172.69,173.07],["And",173.61,173.89],["so",173.89,174.15],["on.",174.15,174.45]]},{"start":175.99,"end":181.43,"text":"Another far-reaching change that has taken place within the last 20 or 30 years","words":[["Another",175.99,176.71],["far",176.71,177.23],["-reaching",177.23,177.63],["change",177.63,178.21],["that",178.21,178.53],["has",178.53,178.69],["taken",178.69,178.91],["place",178.91,179.29],["within",179.29,179.55],["the",179.55,179.71],["last",179.71,180.05],["20",180.05,180.39],["or",180.39,180.63],["30",180.63,180.91],["years",180.91,181.43]]},{"start":181.43,"end":184.79,"text":"concerns the way children themselves are regarded.","words":[["concerns",181.43,182.25],["the",182.25,182.63],["way",182.63,182.79],["children",182.79,183.19],["themselves",183.19,183.75],["are",183.75,184.31],["regarded.",184.31,184.79]]},{"start":185.47,"end":192.09,"text":"Formally, the developing child was regarded as passive, as merely reacting to outside stimulation.","words":[["Formally,",185.47,186.01],["the",186.31,186.43],["developing",186.43,186.79],["child",186.79,187.17],["was",187.17,187.53],["regarded",187.53,187.95],["as",187.95,188.19],["passive,",188.19,188.77],["as",189.01,189.51],["merely",189.51,189.83],["reacting",189.83,190.45],["to",190.45,190.79],["outside",190.79,191.31],["stimulation.",191.31,192.09]]},{"start":192.85,"end":194.95,"text":"Let's take the parent-child relationship.","words":[["Let's",192.85,193.27],["take",193.27,193.41],["the",193.41,193.61],["parent",193.61,193.85],["-child",193.85,194.15],["relationship.",194.15,194.95]]},{"start":194.95,"end":198.73,"text":"This was seen as something that parents did to children.","words":[["This",194.95,195.91],["was",195.91,196.11],["seen",196.11,196.39],["as",196.39,196.55],["something",196.55,196.81],["that",196.81,197.05],["parents",197.05,197.43],["did",197.43,197.89],["to",197.89,198.31],["children.",198.31,198.73]]},{"start":199.17,"end":202.21,"text":"And if something then went wrong, then you blame the parents.","words":[["And",199.17,199.45],["if",199.45,199.57],["something",199.57,199.85],["then",199.85,200.11],["went",200.11,200.31],["wrong,",200.31,200.69],["then",201.07,201.33],["you",201.33,201.43],["blame",201.43,201.63],["the",201.63,201.81],["parents.",201.81,202.21]]},{"start":203.01,"end":205.53,"text":"But this is a view that simply can't be upheld.","words":[["But",203.01,203.27],["this",203.27,203.45],["is",203.45,203.55],["a",203.55,203.67],["view",203.67,203.83],["that",203.83,204.01],["simply",204.01,204.35],["can't",204.35,204.85],["be",204.85,205.03],["upheld.",205.03,205.53]]},{"start":205.77,"end":210.29,"text":"Because we know now that there are no simple straightforward correlations","words":[["Because",205.77,206.13],["we",206.13,206.33],["know",206.33,206.63],["now",206.63,207.03],["that",207.03,207.53],["there",207.53,207.69],["are",207.69,207.85],["no",207.85,208.15],["simple",208.15,208.67],["straightforward",208.67,209.37],["correlations",209.37,210.29]]},{"start":210.29,"end":214.21,"text":"between the early influences on a child and its personality.","words":[["between",210.29,210.89],["the",210.89,211.11],["early",211.11,211.37],["influences",211.37,212.05],["on",212.05,212.35],["a",212.35,212.45],["child",212.45,212.91],["and",212.91,213.41],["its",213.41,213.55],["personality.",213.55,214.21]]},{"start":214.87,"end":218.37,"text":"The reason being that our genes also play a part.","words":[["The",214.87,215.07],["reason",215.07,215.35],["being",215.35,215.67],["that",215.67,216.27],["our",216.27,216.55],["genes",216.55,217.19],["also",217.19,217.71],["play",217.71,217.99],["a",217.99,218.17],["part.",218.17,218.37]]},{"start":223.43,"end":225.23,"text":"And this brings me to the next point.","words":[["And",223.43,223.75],["this",223.75,223.93],["brings",223.93,224.19],["me",224.19,224.39],["to",224.39,224.55],["the",224.55,224.65],["next",224.65,224.87],["point.",224.87,225.23]]},{"start":225.23,"end":231.23,"text":"In the past, ideas were very much influenced by the child psychologist Piaget.","words":[["In",225.23,226.13],["the",226.13,226.27],["past,",226.27,226.71],["ideas",227.07,227.41],["were",227.41,227.71],["very",227.71,227.97],["much",227.97,228.25],["influenced",228.25,228.75],["by",228.75,229.05],["the",229.05,229.19],["child",229.19,229.53],["psychologist",229.53,230.29],["Piaget.",230.29,231.23]]},{"start":231.91,"end":238.59,"text":"Piaget was very insistent that for the first five or six years, all children are self-centered.","words":[["Piaget",231.91,232.57],["was",232.57,232.71],["very",232.71,233.01],["insistent",233.01,233.85],["that",233.85,234.33],["for",234.33,234.51],["the",234.51,234.65],["first",234.65,235.05],["five",235.05,235.51],["or",235.51,235.75],["six",235.75,236.01],["years,",236.01,236.45],["all",236.73,237.05],["children",237.05,237.49],["are",237.49,237.83],["self",237.83,238.21],["-centered.",238.21,238.59]]},{"start":239.21,"end":243.09,"text":"He meant that they project their own feelings and thoughts onto other people.","words":[["He",239.21,239.41],["meant",239.41,239.59],["that",239.59,239.77],["they",239.77,239.87],["project",239.87,240.23],["their",240.23,240.47],["own",240.47,240.85],["feelings",240.85,241.33],["and",241.33,241.67],["thoughts",241.67,242.03],["onto",242.03,242.41],["other",242.41,242.69],["people.",242.69,243.09]]},{"start":243.79,"end":247.17,"text":"But recently, people have started to listen to other views.","words":[["But",243.79,244.03],["recently,",244.03,244.47],["people",245.07,245.31],["have",245.31,245.51],["started",245.51,245.85],["to",245.85,246.09],["listen",246.09,246.31],["to",246.31,246.51],["other",246.51,246.77],["views.",246.77,247.17]]},{"start":247.61,"end":252.73,"text":"For example, the American psychologist Harriet Reingold said all along that","words":[["For",247.61,247.81],["example,",247.81,248.21],["the",248.65,248.73],["American",248.73,249.05],["psychologist",249.05,249.89],["Harriet",249.89,250.53],["Reingold",250.53,251.21],["said",251.21,251.83],["all",251.83,252.07],["along",252.07,252.49],["that",252.49,252.73]]},{"start":252.73,"end":258.21,"text":"But we must listen to young children and the way they talk, and observe them in all sorts","words":[["But",252.73,252.81],["we",252.81,252.89],["must",252.89,253.21],["listen",253.21,253.65],["to",253.65,253.79],["young",253.79,254.03],["children",254.03,254.49],["and",254.49,254.83],["the",254.83,254.97],["way",254.97,255.11],["they",255.11,255.27],["talk,",255.27,255.69],["and",256.03,256.35],["observe",256.35,256.75],["them",256.75,257.07],["in",257.07,257.63],["all",257.63,257.93],["sorts",257.93,258.21]]},{"start":258.21,"end":260.91,"text":"of social situations with an open mind.","words":[["of",258.21,258.47],["social",258.47,258.77],["situations",258.77,259.53],["with",259.53,260.07],["an",260.07,260.19],["open",260.19,260.47],["mind.",260.47,260.91]]},{"start":261.77,"end":266.73,"text":"And she gave examples which illustrate children's awareness of other people very clearly.","words":[["And",261.77,262.05],["she",262.05,262.23],["gave",262.23,262.39],["examples",262.39,262.95],["which",262.95,263.63],["illustrate",263.63,264.15],["children's",264.15,264.75],["awareness",264.75,265.13],["of",265.13,265.41],["other",265.41,265.59],["people",265.59,265.93],["very",265.93,266.25],["clearly.",266.25,266.73]]},{"start":267.35,"end":269.87,"text":"They are not just thinking of themselves all the time.","words":[["They",267.35,267.69],["are",267.69,267.79],["not",267.79,267.99],["just",267.99,268.21],["thinking",268.21,268.47],["of",268.47,268.71],["themselves",268.71,269.07],["all",269.07,269.41],["the",269.41,269.53],["time.",269.53,269.87]]},{"start":270.37,"end":273.29,"text":"And other psychologists have taken up that suggestion.","words":[["And",270.37,270.67],["other",270.67,270.89],["psychologists",270.89,271.53],["have",271.53,272.15],["taken",272.15,272.43],["up",272.43,272.65],["that",272.65,272.81],["suggestion.",272.81,273.29]]},{"start":273.85,"end":276.51,"text":"And yes, we have no end of examples now.","words":[["And",273.85,274.21],["yes,",274.21,274.49],["we",274.63,274.75],["have",274.75,274.97],["no",274.97,275.29],["end",275.29,275.53],["of",275.53,275.67],["examples",275.67,276.13],["now.",276.13,276.51]]},{"start":278.01,"end":280.61,"text":"Then there's another area where things have changed.","words":[["Then",278.01,278.65],["there's",278.65,278.89],["another",278.89,279.09],["area",279.09,279.57],["where",279.57,279.75],["things",279.75,280.01],["have",280.01,280.19],["changed.",280.19,280.61]]},{"start":280.61,"end":286.49,"text":"In the past, we psychologists had a rather lazy attitude towards culture.","words":[["In",280.61,281.35],["the",281.35,281.47],["past,",281.47,281.93],["we",282.29,282.49],["psychologists",282.49,283.17],["had",283.17,283.67],["a",283.67,283.79],["rather",283.79,284.07],["lazy",284.07,284.85],["attitude",284.85,285.57],["towards",285.57,285.97],["culture.",285.97,286.49]]},{"start":287.07,"end":288.73,"text":"It was a factor that we just ignored.","words":[["It",287.07,287.21],["was",287.21,287.33],["a",287.33,287.45],["factor",287.45,287.79],["that",287.79,288.01],["we",288.01,288.11],["just",288.11,288.33],["ignored.",288.33,288.73]]},{"start":289.33,"end":292.55,"text":"If we wanted to study children, we just popped round the corner","words":[["If",289.33,289.53],["we",289.53,289.69],["wanted",289.69,289.91],["to",289.91,290.11],["study",290.11,290.37],["children,",290.37,290.77],["we",291.15,291.33],["just",291.33,291.55],["popped",291.55,291.85],["round",291.85,292.13],["the",292.13,292.27],["corner",292.27,292.55]]},{"start":292.55,"end":295.85,"text":"and got hold of the nearest, most available group of children","words":[["and",292.55,292.81],["got",292.81,293.01],["hold",293.01,293.29],["of",293.29,293.47],["the",293.47,293.59],["nearest,",293.59,293.93],["most",294.29,294.43],["available",294.43,294.85],["group",294.85,295.25],["of",295.25,295.43],["children",295.43,295.85]]},{"start":295.85,"end":300.77,"text":"and then assumed that what we observed applied to children right across the world.","words":[["and",295.85,296.53],["then",296.53,296.67],["assumed",296.67,297.13],["that",297.13,297.69],["what",297.69,297.83],["we",297.83,298.05],["observed",298.05,298.43],["applied",298.43,298.91],["to",298.91,299.13],["children",299.13,299.55],["right",299.55,299.79],["across",299.79,300.09],["the",300.09,300.43],["world.",300.43,300.77]]},{"start":301.43,"end":302.69,"text":"Let's take one example.","words":[["Let's",301.43,301.91],["take",301.91,302.07],["one",302.07,302.27],["example.",302.27,302.69]]},{"start":303.49,"end":307.35,"text":"The importance of stimulation during the first few weeks of life.","words":[["The",303.49,303.59],["importance",303.59,303.99],["of",303.99,304.27],["stimulation",304.27,304.93],["during",304.93,305.65],["the",305.65,305.85],["first",305.85,306.13],["few",306.13,306.47],["weeks",306.47,306.79],["of",306.79,306.99],["life.",306.99,307.35]]},{"start":307.35,"end":316.17,"text":"It was generally thought that if babies are not sung to, talked to, taken out for walks, shown objects, played with, and so on,","words":[["It",307.35,308.21],["was",308.21,308.33],["generally",308.33,308.67],["thought",308.67,309.09],["that",309.09,309.31],["if",309.31,309.43],["babies",309.43,309.73],["are",309.73,309.97],["not",309.97,310.15],["sung",310.15,310.61],["to,",310.61,310.95],["talked",311.37,311.75],["to,",311.75,312.19],["taken",312.39,312.55],["out",312.55,312.79],["for",312.79,312.99],["walks,",312.99,313.43],["shown",313.65,313.85],["objects,",313.85,314.43],["played",314.89,315.09],["with,",315.09,315.39],["and",315.55,315.57],["so",315.57,315.81],["on,",315.81,316.17]]},{"start":316.59,"end":319.01,"text":"then their development was going to be held back.","words":[["then",316.59,316.73],["their",316.73,316.87],["development",316.87,317.37],["was",317.37,317.91],["going",317.91,318.13],["to",318.13,318.29],["be",318.29,318.43],["held",318.43,318.63],["back.",318.63,319.01]]},{"start":319.79,"end":325.43,"text":"But a study in Guatemala showed that this is not the case, at least not in all contexts.","words":[["But",319.79,319.99],["a",319.99,320.09],["study",320.09,320.29],["in",320.29,320.49],["Guatemala",320.49,320.79],["showed",320.79,321.47],["that",321.47,321.99],["this",321.99,322.17],["is",322.17,322.29],["not",322.29,322.49],["the",322.49,322.65],["case,",322.65,322.99],["at",323.41,323.53],["least",323.53,323.83],["not",323.83,324.35],["in",324.35,324.53],["all",324.53,324.77],["contexts.",324.77,325.43]]},{"start":326.27,"end":332.19,"text":"It is the custom for mothers in one area of that country to keep their babies in the house during the first year.","words":[["It",326.27,326.45],["is",326.45,326.57],["the",326.57,326.69],["custom",326.69,327.03],["for",327.03,327.29],["mothers",327.29,327.57],["in",327.57,327.81],["one",327.81,327.99],["area",327.99,328.47],["of",328.47,328.65],["that",328.65,328.85],["country",328.85,329.31],["to",329.31,329.81],["keep",329.81,329.97],["their",329.97,330.15],["babies",330.15,330.45],["in",330.45,330.67],["the",330.67,330.77],["house",330.77,331.05],["during",331.05,331.37],["the",331.37,331.55],["first",331.55,331.77],["year.",331.77,332.19]]},{"start":332.19,"end":336.45,"text":"They never take them out and they don't encourage visitors or noise.","words":[["They",332.19,332.91],["never",332.91,333.23],["take",333.23,333.49],["them",333.49,333.63],["out",333.63,333.95],["and",333.95,334.47],["they",334.47,334.59],["don't",334.59,334.79],["encourage",334.79,335.21],["visitors",335.21,335.63],["or",335.63,336.01],["noise.",336.01,336.45]]},{"start":336.89,"end":342.43,"text":"In other words, they actually prevent them from being exposed to the outside world.","words":[["In",336.89,337.09],["other",337.09,337.23],["words,",337.23,337.53],["they",337.75,337.99],["actually",337.99,338.47],["prevent",338.47,339.23],["them",339.23,339.65],["from",339.65,340.11],["being",340.11,340.39],["exposed",340.39,340.99],["to",340.99,341.53],["the",341.53,341.65],["outside",341.65,341.97],["world.",341.97,342.43]]},{"start":342.91,"end":348.01,"text":"I won't go into the reasons for this, but the point is that these babies develop into","words":[["I",342.91,343.41],["won't",343.41,343.63],["go",343.63,343.77],["into",343.77,343.93],["the",343.93,344.11],["reasons",344.11,344.37],["for",344.37,344.63],["this,",344.63,344.89],["but",345.13,345.43],["the",345.43,345.55],["point",345.55,345.81],["is",345.81,346.13],["that",346.13,346.65],["these",346.65,346.87],["babies",346.87,347.25],["develop",347.25,347.69],["into",347.69,348.01]]},{"start":348.01,"end":352.29,"text":"perfectly normal, healthy, intelligent, bright and active children.","words":[["perfectly",348.01,348.37],["normal,",348.37,348.85],["healthy,",349.19,349.55],["intelligent,",349.79,350.27],["bright",350.53,350.83],["and",350.83,351.23],["active",351.23,351.81],["children.",351.81,352.29]]},{"start":352.71,"end":357.83,"text":"And what happens in that first year or so of life apparently has absolutely no negative","words":[["And",352.71,352.99],["what",352.99,353.13],["happens",353.13,353.51],["in",353.51,353.73],["that",353.73,353.89],["first",353.89,354.15],["year",354.15,354.47],["or",354.47,354.61],["so",354.61,354.79],["of",354.79,354.97],["life",354.97,355.29],["apparently",355.29,356.09],["has",356.09,356.47],["absolutely",356.47,357.11],["no",357.11,357.51],["negative",357.51,357.83]]},{"start":357.83,"end":359.85,"text":"implications for later development.","words":[["implications",357.83,358.47],["for",358.47,359.05],["later",359.05,359.31],["development.",359.31,359.85]]},{"start":359.85,"end":369.65,"text":"So we have to be very careful about the extent to which we make assumptions that everything that we see under our own noses is necessarily universal.","words":[["So",359.85,360.81],["we",360.81,360.95],["have",360.95,361.11],["to",361.11,361.23],["be",361.23,361.33],["very",361.33,361.55],["careful",361.55,362.09],["about",362.09,362.79],["the",362.79,362.99],["extent",362.99,363.47],["to",363.47,363.79],["which",363.79,363.97],["we",363.97,364.13],["make",364.13,364.35],["assumptions",364.35,364.79],["that",364.79,365.39],["everything",365.39,365.81],["that",365.81,366.15],["we",366.15,366.27],["see",366.27,366.53],["under",366.53,366.75],["our",366.75,366.97],["own",366.97,367.25],["noses",367.25,367.89],["is",367.89,368.21],["necessarily",368.21,368.85],["universal.",368.85,369.65]]},{"start":371.17,"end":376.03,"text":"So those are some of the changes that have taken place in psychology in recent years.","words":[["So",371.17,371.81],["those",371.81,372.01],["are",372.01,372.17],["some",372.17,372.39],["of",372.39,372.51],["the",372.51,372.61],["changes",372.61,373.05],["that",373.05,373.65],["have",373.65,373.73],["taken",373.73,373.97],["place",373.97,374.29],["in",374.29,374.51],["psychology",374.51,374.93],["in",374.93,375.31],["recent",375.31,375.61],["years.",375.61,376.03]]},{"start":376.47,"end":377.61,"text":"But what about the future?","words":[["But",376.47,376.81],["what",376.81,376.93],["about",376.93,377.11],["the",377.11,377.29],["future?",377.29,377.61]]},{"start":378.33,"end":384.83,"text":"There's already been some very interesting work which suggests that learning is possible even at the prenatal stage.","words":[["There's",378.33,378.63],["already",378.63,378.99],["been",378.99,379.33],["some",379.33,379.57],["very",379.57,379.95],["interesting",379.95,380.35],["work",380.35,380.73],["which",380.73,381.27],["suggests",381.27,381.65],["that",381.65,381.93],["learning",381.93,382.23],["is",382.23,382.45],["possible",382.45,382.95],["even",382.95,383.57],["at",383.57,383.77],["the",383.77,383.87],["prenatal",383.87,384.49],["stage.",384.49,384.83]]},{"start":385.49,"end":389.13,"text":"The most obvious example is the infant's ability to recognize voices.","words":[["The",385.49,385.71],["most",385.71,385.85],["obvious",385.85,386.21],["example",386.21,386.73],["is",386.73,386.99],["the",386.99,387.13],["infant's",387.13,387.65],["ability",387.65,388.01],["to",388.01,388.33],["recognize",388.33,388.81],["voices.",388.81,389.13]]},{"start":389.13,"end":394.71,"text":"voices. It's been shown that the moment a child is born, and as soon as one can possibly","words":[["voices.",389.13,389.49],["It's",390.17,390.59],["been",390.59,390.73],["shown",390.73,391.09],["that",391.09,391.33],["the",391.33,391.45],["moment",391.45,391.83],["a",391.83,392.05],["child",392.05,392.31],["is",392.31,392.51],["born,",392.51,392.81],["and",393.23,393.47],["as",393.47,393.63],["soon",393.63,393.83],["as",393.83,393.93],["one",393.93,394.11],["can",394.11,394.27],["possibly",394.27,394.71]]},{"start":394.71,"end":400.65,"text":"test it, it is already capable of differentiating the mother's voice from that of another female","words":[["test",394.71,395.09],["it,",395.09,395.27],["it",395.77,395.93],["is",395.93,396.03],["already",396.03,396.37],["capable",396.37,396.83],["of",396.83,397.49],["differentiating",397.49,398.25],["the",398.25,398.45],["mother's",398.45,398.83],["voice",398.83,399.15],["from",399.15,399.67],["that",399.67,399.85],["of",399.85,399.99],["another",399.99,400.25],["female",400.25,400.65]]},{"start":400.65,"end":406.75,"text":"stranger. And there's simply no explanation other than that the child has acquired this","words":[["stranger.",400.65,401.19],["And",401.73,402.01],["there's",402.01,402.17],["simply",402.17,402.47],["no",402.47,402.79],["explanation",402.79,403.45],["other",403.45,404.29],["than",404.29,404.63],["that",404.63,405.11],["the",405.11,405.27],["child",405.27,405.75],["has",405.75,406.01],["acquired",406.01,406.47],["this",406.47,406.75]]},{"start":406.75,"end":412.65,"text":"knowledge in the womb. So if I'm asked what's likely to attract a lot of interesting work","words":[["knowledge",406.75,407.21],["in",407.21,407.75],["the",407.75,407.91],["womb.",407.91,408.23],["So",409.09,409.45],["if",409.45,409.63],["I'm",409.63,409.89],["asked",409.89,410.13],["what's",410.13,410.41],["likely",410.41,410.69],["to",410.69,410.91],["attract",410.91,411.39],["a",411.39,411.63],["lot",411.63,411.83],["of",411.83,411.97],["interesting",411.97,412.35],["work",412.35,412.65]]},{"start":418.65,"end":420.91,"text":"That is the end of part 4.","words":[["That",418.65,419.33],["is",419.33,419.53],["the",419.53,419.69],["end",419.69,420.05],["of",420.05,420.21],["part",420.21,420.43],["4.",420.43,420.91]]},{"start":421.81,"end":425.93,"text":"You now have 45 seconds to check your answers to part 4.","words":[["You",421.81,422.01],["now",422.01,422.31],["have",422.31,422.65],["45",422.65,423.29],["seconds",423.29,423.83],["to",423.83,424.21],["check",424.21,424.45],["your",424.45,424.63],["answers",424.63,425.05],["to",425.05,425.29],["part",425.29,425.51],["4.",425.51,425.93]]}]}